\f0\b \cf0 NumPy vs Pure Python
\f1\b0 \
NumPy is a Python library for: fast mathematical operations on arrays and matrices\
Pure Python: \
	interpreted one line at a time \
	slow loops not optimized for math \
NumPy: \
	written in C under the hood \
	uses SIMD CPU instructions \
	operates on entire arrays at once \
	same concept as GPU parallelism but on CPU!\
\
